# SettingsShell — the settings window, General, Permissions, Advanced, About and the main menu.
"About" = "关于"
"About Rolltop" = "关于 Rolltop"
"Acknowledgments" = "致谢"
"Add Item" = "添加项"
"Advanced" = "高级"
"Available" = "可用"
"Cancel" = "取消"
"Close" = "关闭"
"Copied" = "已拷贝"
"Copy" = "拷贝"
"Couldn’t change this setting: %@" = "无法更改此设置：%@"
"Cut" = "剪切"
"Delete" = "删除"
"Diagnostics" = "诊断信息"
"Done" = "完成"
"Edit" = "编辑"
"Every item goes back to Shown and every other Rolltop setting to its default. Open at login and permissions stay as they are." = "所有项都会回到“显示”分区，Rolltop 的其他设置也会恢复默认。“登录时打开”和权限保持不变。"
"General" = "通用"
"Hiding menu bar items" = "隐藏菜单栏项"
"Keep visible when hiding everything" = "全部隐藏时保持可见"
"Keeps your menu bar tidy: hide the items you don’t need all the time and bring them back with a click." = "让菜单栏保持整洁：隐藏不常用的项，点按一下即可让它们重新出现。"
"Last problem" = "最近的问题"
"Lets Rolltop see which items are in the menu bar, and open hidden ones." = "让 Rolltop 看到菜单栏中有哪些项，并打开隐藏的项。"
"Minimize" = "最小化"
"No results" = "无结果"
"None" = "无"
"Open Login Items" = "打开登录项"
"Open at login" = "登录时打开"
"Parts of Rolltop are adapted from Hidden Bar by Dwarves Foundation and Console Labs, used under the MIT License." = "Rolltop 的部分代码改写自 Dwarves Foundation 和 Console Labs 的 Hidden Bar，依据 MIT 许可证使用。"
"Paste" = "粘贴"
"Permissions" = "权限"
"Quit Rolltop" = "退出 Rolltop"
"Redo" = "重做"
"Remove" = "移除"
"Reset" = "重置"
"Reset all settings" = "重置所有设置"
"Reset all settings?" = "要重置所有设置吗？"
"Reset…" = "重置…"
"Search" = "搜索"
"Section for new items" = "新项所在分区"
"Select All" = "全选"
"Select a category" = "选择一个类别"
"Settings" = "设置"
"Settings…" = "设置…"
"Show License" = "显示许可证"
"Shows the real icons of hidden items. Without it, Rolltop shows app icons instead." = "显示隐藏项的真实图标。没有此权限时，Rolltop 会改为显示 App 图标。"
"Rolltop can’t hide or list menu bar items until you allow Device Control and Data Access." = "在你允许“设备控制和数据访问”之前，Rolltop 无法隐藏或列出菜单栏项。"
"Rolltop is an independent app. It is not made, endorsed or supported by Apple or by the makers of any other menu bar app." = "Rolltop 是一款独立 App，并非由 Apple 或任何其他菜单栏 App 的开发者制作、认可或支持。"
"Rolltop is running from %@. macOS hides the menu bar items of apps outside the Applications folder, Rolltop’s own included. Move Rolltop to Applications and open it again." = "Rolltop 正在从 %@ 运行。macOS 会隐藏“应用程序”文件夹之外的 App 的菜单栏项，Rolltop 自己的也不例外。请将 Rolltop 移到“应用程序”文件夹并重新打开。"
"Rolltop starts when you log in, so hidden items stay hidden." = "Rolltop 会在你登录时启动，因此隐藏项会保持隐藏。"
"This can’t be undone." = "此操作无法撤销。"
"This version of macOS doesn’t offer what Rolltop uses to hide items, so every item stays visible." = "此版本的 macOS 不提供 Rolltop 隐藏项所需的功能，因此所有项都会保持可见。"
"Unavailable" = "不可用"
"Undo" = "撤销"
"Version %@ (%@)" = "版本 %1$@（%2$@）"
"Versions, permissions, where Rolltop runs from and whether it is hiding anything. No item names or settings." = "版本、权限、Rolltop 的运行位置以及是否正在隐藏项。不含项名称或设置。"
"Waiting for your approval in System Settings › General › Login Items & Extensions." = "正在等待你在“系统设置 › 通用 › 登录项与扩展”中批准。"
"When Rolltop also hides the items you normally see, these stay in the menu bar." = "当 Rolltop 连你平时看到的项也一并隐藏时，这些项仍会留在菜单栏中。"
"Where apps go the first time they show up in the menu bar. Items already there keep their section." = "App 第一次出现在菜单栏时所放入的分区。已在菜单栏中的项保持原有分区。"
"Window" = "窗口"
"device control, data access, accessibility, screen recording, system audio, privacy, access, allow" = "权限, 设备控制, 数据访问, 无障碍, 辅助功能, 录屏, 屏幕录制, 系统录音, 隐私, 访问, 允许"
"diagnostics, reset, troubleshoot, debug" = "高级, 诊断, 重置, 故障排除, 调试"
"login, startup, launch, new items, default section, menu bar icon, status item, symbol, pinned, keep visible, hide everything" = "通用, 登录, 启动, 新项, 默认分区, 菜单栏图标, 状态项, 符号, 保持可见, 全部隐藏"
"macOS lets Rolltop hide items on this Mac." = "macOS 允许 Rolltop 在这台 Mac 上隐藏项。"
"version, acknowledgments, licenses, credits" = "关于, 版本, 致谢, 许可证, 鸣谢"
# Menu bar icon choice (General pane). "Rolltop" is Rolltop's own glyph, not the Shelf.
"Menu bar icon" = "菜单栏图标"
"How Rolltop’s icon looks in the menu bar. It changes while hidden items are shown." = "Rolltop 图标在菜单栏中的样子。显示隐藏项时它会改变。"
"Stack" = "堆叠"
"Rolltop" = "Rolltop"
"Box" = "盒子"
"Dots" = "圆点"
"Arrow" = "箭头"
"Eye" = "眼睛"
# Permissions › Features that need your permission (consent rows).
"Features that need your permission" = "需要你许可的功能"
"macOS records each permission for the app that asks for it. Open Rolltop the usual way (from Applications, Spotlight or at login) before you allow anything here." = "macOS 会把每项权限记录给发起请求的 App。请先以常规方式打开 Rolltop（从“应用程序”文件夹、聚焦或登录时打开），再在这里允许任何权限。"
"This Rolltop was started from a terminal. macOS would record what you allow now for the terminal instead of Rolltop, so these buttons are off. Quit Rolltop and open it from Applications." = "这个 Rolltop 是从终端启动的。现在允许的权限会被 macOS 记录给终端而不是 Rolltop，因此这些按钮已停用。请退出 Rolltop，再从“应用程序”文件夹打开它。"
"Change this in System Settings." = "可在系统设置中更改。"
"Allow…" = "允许…"
"Open System Settings" = "打开系统设置"
"Location Services" = "定位服务"
"Lets Rolltop read the name of the current Wi-Fi network and check place conditions in automations." = "让 Rolltop 读取当前 Wi-Fi 网络的名称，并在自动化中检查地点条件。"
"Turn on Location Services in System Settings › Privacy & Security." = "在“系统设置 › 隐私与安全”中打开定位服务。"
"Location Services are restricted on this Mac." = "此 Mac 上的定位服务受到限制。"
# Show or hide Rolltop's icon (General pane). The caption names the ways back to Settings.
"Show Rolltop in the menu bar" = "在菜单栏中显示 Rolltop"
"If you hide it, open Rolltop again from Finder or Spotlight to get back here. A shortcut you set in Shortcuts or the link rolltop://settings also works." = "隐藏后，从访达或聚焦再次打开 Rolltop 即可回到这里。也可以使用在“快捷键”中设置的快捷键或链接 rolltop://settings。"
"With Rolltop’s icon hidden, nothing shows hidden items: clicking the empty menu bar, hovering, scrolling and shortcuts are all off. Turn one on in Reveal or Shortcuts." = "Rolltop 图标隐藏后，没有任何方式能显示隐藏项：点按菜单栏空白处、悬停、滚动和快捷键都已关闭。请在“显示与收起”或“快捷键”中打开其中一种。"
